# This folder holds Kitty session files: definitions of tabs, windows,
# layouts, working directories and programs to launch on startup.
#
# Session files in this folder are ignored by Git since they are
# machine-specific; only this template is tracked.
#
# To create a session, copy this file and define your own setup:
#   cp template.session my-project.session
#   kitty --session sessions/my-project.session
#
# Documentation: https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/sessions
